  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VSO RAISA:HIV prevention Phase III 2008-2012 - VSO-Raisa, HIV/AIDS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">VSO RAISA:HIV prevention Phase III 2008-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med VSO RAISA &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka den tekniska kapaciteten av hiv / aids serviceorganisationer i s&#xf6;dra Afrika i hiv-prevention,, promtiong flickors r&#xe4;ttigheter och barns och mildra socioekonomiska effekter genom f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjningsm&#xf6;jligheter, kompetens byggnad och p&#xe5;verkar politiken. Andra givare &#xe4;r DFID, Merck &amp; Co</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of VSO RAISA is to strengthen the technical capacity of HIV/AIDS service organizations in Southern Africa in HIV prevention, , promtiong the rights of girls and children and mitigating socio economic impacts through livelihoods, skills building and influencing policies. Other donors are DFiD, Merck and Co.</narrative>
  </description>
